\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{Accretivity and the determinant sign}
\date{2026-11-09}

\p{Accretivity and the grading have distinct roles: the scalar endomorphism #{m+i} is strictly accretive but has nonreal determinant. The sign conclusion is restricted to the displayed graded class. The connection measure #{\nu} of \ref{fdip-00IP} is a measure on ordinary connections; no positivity of a Grassmann coefficient functional has been asserted.}
